<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova Jan-Mar trade deficit widens to $99.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Moldova Jan-Mar trade deficit widens to $99.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's trade deficit widened to $99.1 million in Jan-March of 1997 from $86.4 million in the same period in 1996, the State Statistics Department said.</p>
<p> MOLDOVAN FOREIGN TRADE	 Jan-March'97  Jan-March'96</p>
<p> Exports			    174.5	   160.9</p>
<p> Imports			    273.6	   247.3</p>
<p> Balance			    -99.1	   -86.4</p>
<p>Note: figures in millions of dollars.</p>
</text>
